From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:02:25 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 151/155] GreatDANE: stronger dane.surf update-log claim, gated
 on dane_update_masked evidence (round 5b)

GATED. The coordinator approved option (a): Curb Appeal is adding a
dane.surf /update/ location that logs with dane_update_masked (path
reduced so build ID and locale are '-', plus status, UA and a masked
IP), a separate dane.surf access log, and a www.dane.surf redirect.

This commit restores the stronger wording for dane.surf's own
update-check logs only: those lines do not log build ID or locale,
and IPs are truncated (/24 IPv4, /48 IPv6). It does not claim
anything about the server's default log. Rare server-error logs can
contain a full IP. "Full IPs before November 10, 2026" remains
scoped to pepecoin.surf.

Do not treat this wording as proven until Curb Appeal's
dane_update_masked /update/ location plus a masked sample line
are in place. If that does not land, restore the previous commit
(honest option-b wording).
---
 greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md   |  4 ++--
 greatdane/macos/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy | 24 +++++++++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md b/greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md
index b72ab78..838b229 100644
--- a/greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md
+++ b/greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md
@@ -23,9 +23,9 @@ If a feature only collects after the user turns it on, it's still declared.
   OtherDiagnosticData entry: Linked=false, Tracking=false, purpose AppFunctionality.
   For the Dane update check the purpose is AppFunctionality only; the entry also carries Analytics because of Mozilla's opt-in telemetry.
 
-  The automatic update check sends product, version, build ID, target, locale and channel to Dane's update server (dane.surf), as parts of the request path. The dane.surf vhost's own access-log lines record that request path (without any query string), the request status, the user agent and a masked IP address (/24 for IPv4, /48 for IPv6). Referrers are not logged. This wording describes only dane.surf's own log lines, not the server's default log. Rare server-error logs can contain a full IP. Logs are kept about 14 days, are not linked to an account or device, and are not shared. Before November 10, 2026, update checks went to pepecoin.surf, whose logs kept full client IP addresses until then; those older pepecoin.surf entries rotate out around November 25, 2026. No check happens while the DisableAppUpdate policy is on.
+  The automatic update check sends product, version, build ID, target, locale and channel to Dane's update server (dane.surf). For dane.surf's own update-check logs (the dane.surf /update/ location, format dane_update_masked), the server logs only product, version, platform and channel, plus the request status, the user agent and a masked IP (/24 for IPv4, /48 for IPv6). Build ID, locale, query strings and referrers are not logged in those dane.surf update-check log lines. This wording describes only dane.surf's own log lines, not the server's default log. Rare server-error logs can contain a full IP. Logs are kept about 14 days, are not linked to an account or device, and are not shared. Before November 10, 2026, update-check log entries on pepecoin.surf kept full client IP addresses; they rotate out around November 25, 2026. No check happens while the DisableAppUpdate policy is on.
 
-  The update URL is https://dane.surf/update/3/.... This unofficial build does not publish update.xml. https://dane.surf/releases/ 301s to /download/ (as of 2026-11-10).
+  The update URL is https://dane.surf/update/3/.... This unofficial build does not publish update.xml. https://dane.surf/releases/ 301s to /download/ (as of 2026-11-10). This stronger update-log claim is gated on Curb Appeal evidence of the dane.surf /update/ location with dane_update_masked (build ID and locale replaced with '-') plus a masked sample line.
 
   (DisableAppUpdate makes `UpdateServiceStub.updateDisabled` true: toolkit/mozapps/update/UpdateServiceStub.sys.mjs:209-215.)
 - **Default new-tab tiles:** the icons for dane.surf, greatdane.doge and grokipedia.com are bundled
